    {"lyric": "Juwieseo dadeul mutji hiphabi mwonyago", "lyric_hangul": "주위에서 다들 묻지 힙합이 뭐냐고", "lyric_translation": "Everyone asks me, what is hip hop?", "range": [212.73, 216.12], "ans": [2]},
